A new Wokku release is available for your server.

  Installed: <%= @current %>
  Latest:    <%= @latest %>

To update, run this on the server (it keeps your data and settings):

  cd /opt/wokku && sudo bash install.sh

The update downloads the new version, restarts the dashboard (your apps
keep running) and updates the agent. Dashboard: <%= @dashboard_url %>

You get one email per release. To stop update checks, set
WOKKU_UPDATE_CHECK=0 in /opt/wokku/.env.
